{"3650580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Golden Tides", "steam_appid": 3650580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/de6e58fa9ec7c2871c2c013433dbe83c.avif?t=1786346187\" width=1421 height=750 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/175e7c448c8bc522b9b261bf6c3e735c.webp?t=1786346187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras_big/175e7c448c8bc522b9b261bf6c3e735c.webp?t=1786346187 width=800 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golden Tides is a 4v4 adventure MOBA built around WASD combat. No lane phase. No towers. Fight across open islands, dungeons, and hidden temples in fast 20-25 minute matches where your crew explores, brawls, and loots together. Between fights, you and your crew take to the sea with full ship-to-ship MOBA combat, where every cannonshot is a skillshot. Every match plays different. Every match feels like an adventure.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/25be4fd3bc2a2210cd17e7cabad8f5db.poster.avif?t=1786346187\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/25be4fd3bc2a2210cd17e7cabad8f5db.webm?t=1786346187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/25be4fd3bc2a2210cd17e7cabad8f5db.mp4?t=1786346187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Every match is an adventure across three islands, randomly chosen from a growing roster. Both crews land on the same island, fighting NPCs and each other while hunting for a buried treasure map. The crew that grabs it first sets sail with a lead. Between islands, crews clash in ship-to-ship combat. The second island has one treasure. Find it, grab it, and get it back to your ship before the other crew takes it from you. The final island has a delivery point. Fight to deliver the treasure and win. Along the way, spend gold at shops to buy items and grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/666df81860048b1460dcace6ee5cec01.webp?t=1786346187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras_big/666df81860048b1460dcace6ee5cec01.webp?t=1786346187 width=800 height=30 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the deep, skill-based gameplay you’d expect from top-tier MOBAs. Whether you’re setting up the perfect engage, punishing a greedy overextend, or outplaying foes in tense PvP duels, every victory comes down to a mix of sharp execution and smart strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/d260463e730ae19676784a237e629a98.webp?t=1786346187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras_big/d260463e730ae19676784a237e629a98.webp?t=1786346187 width=800 height=30 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in ability-based ship combat where timing, positioning, and teamwork shape every outcome. Every cannon volley, mortar blast, and harpoon strike is a skillshot, turning sea battles into tactical, high-stakes encounters just as intense as any fight on land.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/21e6066b2660551dd642a850201d3c8d.webp?t=1786346187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras_big/21e6066b2660551dd642a850201d3c8d.webp?t=1786346187 width=800 height=30 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a brawler, assassin, marksman, or strategist, Golden Tides lets you choose your path. Farm PvE for treasure and loot to power up, or hunt enemy crews for high-risk, high-reward dominance. However you play, every match is different.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/71b72ca86a199ee6296958d57ab05212.webp?t=1786346187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras_big/71b72ca86a199ee6296958d57ab05212.webp?t=1786346187 width=800 height=30 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match unfolds in a massive open world with dynamic events, taking the endless replayability of MOBAs to ludicrous levels. And with constant updates, special events, and even more game modes on the horizon, there’s always something new to discover in Golden Tides.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/fbbd09944e6917eb8c71abde45260efc.poster.avif?t=1786346187\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/fbbd09944e6917eb8c71abde45260efc.webm?t=1786346187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/fbbd09944e6917eb8c71abde45260efc.mp4?t=1786346187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/ff9eb098734ca251a94bc68d2b36d84d.webp?t=1786346187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras_big/ff9eb098734ca251a94bc68d2b36d84d.webp?t=1786346187 width=800 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an ever-growing roster of playable pirates, from the sea elf General Almandee-Breeze who commands the tides themselves, to the ruthless Captain Ashar Sharp and the frost-wielding mage Helios, you’re sure to find a hero that fits your playstyle. Whether you prefer frontline tanks, control mages, ranged casters, or stealthy assassins, every pirate brings their own personality, backstory, and unique abilities to the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/0960a260a6103aa4b14d69318e4d26eb.poster.avif?t=1786346187\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/0960a260a6103aa4b14d69318e4d26eb.webm?t=1786346187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/0960a260a6103aa4b14d69318e4d26eb.mp4?t=1786346187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/c3bec1661a8fde8bbb514f3dd518200f.webp?t=1786346187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras_big/c3bec1661a8fde8bbb514f3dd518200f.webp?t=1786346187 width=800 height=30 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a strategic mastermind, a fearless brawler, or something in between, <strong>Golden Tides</strong> is designed to be played your way. Pick your fights carefully, or avoid them altogether. Farm PvE mobs to power up at your own pace, or go full aggression and hunt down enemy crews for high-risk, high-reward dominance. Every match offers multiple paths to victory, so play smart, play bold, or play dirty. The sea doesn’t judge, but it does remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/083c7f33da5de04f0bc2c47a7789bcaa.avif?t=1786346187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras_big/083c7f33da5de04f0bc2c47a7789bcaa.avif?t=1786346187 width=800 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golden Tides</strong> is built by <strong>Psychedelic Games</strong>, a global crew with deep roots in MOBAs, competitive gaming, and top-tier storytelling. Our team includes veterans behind some of the biggest online games in the world, and now we’re channeling that experience into something bold, fresh, and unforgettable.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/de6e58fa9ec7c2871c2c013433dbe83c.avif?t=1786346187\" width=1421 height=750 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/175e7c448c8bc522b9b261bf6c3e735c.webp?t=1786346187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras_big/175e7c448c8bc522b9b261bf6c3e735c.webp?t=1786346187 width=800 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golden Tides is a 4v4 adventure MOBA built around WASD combat. No lane phase. No towers. Fight across open islands, dungeons, and hidden temples in fast 20-25 minute matches where your crew explores, brawls, and loots together. Between fights, you and your crew take to the sea with full ship-to-ship MOBA combat, where every cannonshot is a skillshot. Every match plays different. Every match feels like an adventure.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/25be4fd3bc2a2210cd17e7cabad8f5db.poster.avif?t=1786346187\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/25be4fd3bc2a2210cd17e7cabad8f5db.webm?t=1786346187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/25be4fd3bc2a2210cd17e7cabad8f5db.mp4?t=1786346187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Every match is an adventure across three islands, randomly chosen from a growing roster. Both crews land on the same island, fighting NPCs and each other while hunting for a buried treasure map. The crew that grabs it first sets sail with a lead. Between islands, crews clash in ship-to-ship combat. The second island has one treasure. Find it, grab it, and get it back to your ship before the other crew takes it from you. The final island has a delivery point. Fight to deliver the treasure and win. Along the way, spend gold at shops to buy items and grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/666df81860048b1460dcace6ee5cec01.webp?t=1786346187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras_big/666df81860048b1460dcace6ee5cec01.webp?t=1786346187 width=800 height=30 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the deep, skill-based gameplay you’d expect from top-tier MOBAs. Whether you’re setting up the perfect engage, punishing a greedy overextend, or outplaying foes in tense PvP duels, every victory comes down to a mix of sharp execution and smart strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/d260463e730ae19676784a237e629a98.webp?t=1786346187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras_big/d260463e730ae19676784a237e629a98.webp?t=1786346187 width=800 height=30 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in ability-based ship combat where timing, positioning, and teamwork shape every outcome. Every cannon volley, mortar blast, and harpoon strike is a skillshot, turning sea battles into tactical, high-stakes encounters just as intense as any fight on land.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/21e6066b2660551dd642a850201d3c8d.webp?t=1786346187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras_big/21e6066b2660551dd642a850201d3c8d.webp?t=1786346187 width=800 height=30 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a brawler, assassin, marksman, or strategist, Golden Tides lets you choose your path. Farm PvE for treasure and loot to power up, or hunt enemy crews for high-risk, high-reward dominance. However you play, every match is different.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/71b72ca86a199ee6296958d57ab05212.webp?t=1786346187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras_big/71b72ca86a199ee6296958d57ab05212.webp?t=1786346187 width=800 height=30 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match unfolds in a massive open world with dynamic events, taking the endless replayability of MOBAs to ludicrous levels. And with constant updates, special events, and even more game modes on the horizon, there’s always something new to discover in Golden Tides.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/fbbd09944e6917eb8c71abde45260efc.poster.avif?t=1786346187\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/fbbd09944e6917eb8c71abde45260efc.webm?t=1786346187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/fbbd09944e6917eb8c71abde45260efc.mp4?t=1786346187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/ff9eb098734ca251a94bc68d2b36d84d.webp?t=1786346187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras_big/ff9eb098734ca251a94bc68d2b36d84d.webp?t=1786346187 width=800 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an ever-growing roster of playable pirates, from the sea elf General Almandee-Breeze who commands the tides themselves, to the ruthless Captain Ashar Sharp and the frost-wielding mage Helios, you’re sure to find a hero that fits your playstyle. Whether you prefer frontline tanks, control mages, ranged casters, or stealthy assassins, every pirate brings their own personality, backstory, and unique abilities to the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/0960a260a6103aa4b14d69318e4d26eb.poster.avif?t=1786346187\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/0960a260a6103aa4b14d69318e4d26eb.webm?t=1786346187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/0960a260a6103aa4b14d69318e4d26eb.mp4?t=1786346187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/c3bec1661a8fde8bbb514f3dd518200f.webp?t=1786346187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras_big/c3bec1661a8fde8bbb514f3dd518200f.webp?t=1786346187 width=800 height=30 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a strategic mastermind, a fearless brawler, or something in between, <strong>Golden Tides</strong> is designed to be played your way. Pick your fights carefully, or avoid them altogether. Farm PvE mobs to power up at your own pace, or go full aggression and hunt down enemy crews for high-risk, high-reward dominance. Every match offers multiple paths to victory, so play smart, play bold, or play dirty. The sea doesn’t judge, but it does remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/083c7f33da5de04f0bc2c47a7789bcaa.avif?t=1786346187\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras_big/083c7f33da5de04f0bc2c47a7789bcaa.avif?t=1786346187 width=800 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golden Tides</strong> is built by <strong>Psychedelic Games</strong>, a global crew with deep roots in MOBAs, competitive gaming, and top-tier storytelling. Our team includes veterans behind some of the biggest online games in the world, and now we’re channeling that experience into something bold, fresh, and unforgettable.</p>", "short_description": "Forget everything you know about MOBAs. Gather your crew and charge into explosive 4v4 battles across land and sea in Golden Tides. Whether you sail for glory or just for the chaos, every 20–25 minute voyage brings unpredictable encounters, epic ship battles, and tales worth telling at the tavern.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/a32aa4f5ec399fd14f1676b9fb145e00d4a5ed98/header.jpg?t=1786346187", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/ad00600ea822eea7433828c3a1b160de0810df81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786346187", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/ad00600ea822eea7433828c3a1b160de0810df81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786346187", "website": "https://www.goldentides.gg/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 64 Bit (latest update)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-6600 or AMD Ryzen™ 5 1400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 960 / AMD Radeon™ RX 470<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 23 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 64 Bit (latest update) or Windows® 11 64 Bit (latest update)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 4790 / AMD Ryzen 3 1300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce® GTX 1660 6GB / AMD Radeon™ RX 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 23 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "All trademarks referenced herein are the properties of their respective owners.<br />\r\n©2026 Psychedelic Games. All rights reserved.", "developers": ["Psychedelic Games"], "publishers": ["Psychedelic Games"], "packag